OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 29 MAR
OL,4,G0630FBreakfast
OL,5,     GMark Forrest presents Radio 3's
OL,6,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,7,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,8,G0900FSunday Morning
OL,9,     GJoin Petroc Trelawny for three
OL,10,     Ghours of classical masterpieces,
OL,11,     Gthe perfect start to your Sunday.
OL,12,G1200FPrivate Passions
OL,13,     GMichael Berkeley's guest is the
OL,14,     Gaward-winning comedian and writer
OL,15,     GMiranda Hart.
OL,16,G1330FMusic Map
OL,17,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch explores
OL,18,     GVivaldi's setting of the Stabat
OL,19,     GMater, a 13th-century hymn to the
OL,20,     GVirgin Mary. Featuring medieval
OL,21,     Gmusic and sacred works from
OL,22,     GDvorak, Handel and Gounod.
